      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Toupeira. Drilbur escava a cerca de 48 km/h, sendo capaz de competir com um carro na superfície. Ele une as duas garras e gira em alta velocidade para atravessar o solo rapidamente.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Campo &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Drilbur pode evoluir para Excadrill no nível 11 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Mud Sport, Scratch</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Rapid Spin</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Mud-Slap</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Fury Swipes</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Metal Claw</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Dig</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Crush Claw, Hone Claws</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Slash</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Rock Slide</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Earthquake</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Swords Dance</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Sandstorm</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Drill Run, Fissure</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Aerial Ace, Attract, Brick Break, Bulldoze, Confide, Curse, Dig, Double Team, Double-Edge, Drill Run, Earth Power, Earthquake, Endure, Facade, Fling, Frustration, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, High Horsepower, Iron Defense, Metal Claw, Metal Sound, Mud Shot, Mud- Slap, Poison Jab, Protect, Rest, Return, Rock Slide, Rock Tomb, Round, Sand Tomb, Sandstorm, Scorching Sands, Shadow Claw, Sleep Talk, Sludge Bomb, Snore, Stealth Rock, Stomping Tantrum, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swords Dance, Take Down, Tera Blast, Toxic, X-Scissor</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Crush Claw, Earth Power, Iron Defense, Metal Sound, Rapid Spin, Rock Climb, Skull Bash, Slash, Submission</p>",
